[PrintTextModified Text:我咬紧牙关按下按钮。|#CommonBad09_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:而被选出的人——|#CommonBad09_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

