[PrintTextModified Text:哎，这已经是最终决定了。<br>虽然很遗憾，但只能请你接受这个结果了。<br>我想早点闭庭……能让我继续下一个环节了吗？|#CommonBad09_Warden001| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:典狱长下达了指示，<br>看守开始准备绑住亚里沙。|#CommonBad09_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Fearful1,ArmR7,ArmL3,Angle01/Facial/Sweat>Sweat02
[PrintTextModified Text:喂！给我等下！|#CommonBad09_Alisa004| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Fearful1,ArmR9,ArmL8,Angle01/Facial/Sweat>Sweat02
[PrintTextModified Text:我不接受……<br>凭什么我要被无理处死！|#CommonBad09_Alisa005| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

