[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙的手上亮起魔法的火焰。|#CommonBad09_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,ArmR5,ArmL11,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open04,Angle01/Facial/Sweat>Sweat02
[PrintTextModified Text:别靠近我！再靠近就烧了你们！|#CommonBad09_Alisa006| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
[PrintTextModified Text:看她的声音和表情就知道，<br>亚里沙的话并非恐吓。|#CommonBad09_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但是，看守根本就不吃这套。<br>它不怕火焰，步步逼近亚里沙。|#CommonBad09_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Fearful1,ArmR5,ArmL11,Angle01/Facial/Sweat>Sweat02
[PrintTextModified Text:别过来！不许过来我这……！！|#CommonBad09_Alisa007| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.11
[PrintTextModified Text:哎呀呀……不可以抵抗哦。<br>不过，抵抗也是白费力气。|#CommonBad09_Warden002| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

