[PrintTextModified Text:少女们发出了惨叫。<br>看守挥动镰刀，将亚里沙劈开。|#CommonBad09_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙分成了两半，<br>她的鲜血染红了审判庭。|#CommonBad09_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.11
